4. HOW TO ASK

Open an issue addressed to @haldarsaurav at:
https://github.com/haldarsaurav/desk_radar_esp32/issues

If issues are unavailable, use a contact method the Owner publishes on:
https://github.com/haldarsaurav

State who you are; which files, version, visuals or features you want to
reuse; your purpose; whether it is commercial; what you will distribute;
and whether AI tools, models, datasets or retrieval systems are involved.
Do not post passwords or other private information in a public request.

Wait for an explicit written grant from the Owner that covers the proposed
use. Silence, a request, a star, a fork, repository access, or approval from
someone else is not permission. Permission is limited to its stated scope,
recipient, purpose and conditions; permission for one activity does not
imply permission for other activities or users. A written instruction from
the Owner to an agent or collaborator authorizes only that instructed work.

